It is becoming evening.
I am returning to the flat.
I walk towards the bus stop.
I know the way now.
I do not ask anyone the way.
"Go straight, and then turn left."
I say to myself.
I walk straight along the way.
And then I turn left.
That is the main road.
There is a big bus stop there.
My bus comes.
I get on the bus.
I look outside through the window.
The bus goes through Kochi city.
I think about my flat.
The route from the city to the flat is clear now.
I am very happy.
